## Modules: controlMP.sys

## Help Drop Menu

DestroyMenu MenuStart
AddToMenu MenuStart
+ "Info " $[infostore.EDT] $[SUP_DIR]/help/info.txt
+ "Bindings " $[infostore.EDT] $[EXT_DIR]/Binding.sys

+ "How To " Exec exec display -size 960x540 $[HOME]/.fvwm/Setup/help/Xfce-FvwmEXT-help.png

## Set small icons

SetEnv smallIcons $[EXT_DIR]/Modules/ControlMinPanel/icons

## Panel

DestroyModuleConfig ControlMP: *
*ControlMP: Geometry 350x32-140+10
*ControlMP: Fore #ffffff
*ControlMP: Back #2b4e5e
*ControlMP: PressColorset 4
*ControlMP: Frame 0
*ControlMP: Rows 1
*ControlMP: Pixmap none
*ControlMP: Font "xft:Sans:size=12:antialias=True"
  
*ControlMP: (1x1, Icon $[smallIcons]/search-wb.png, Action(Mouse 1) "Exec exec xfce4-appfinder" )
*ControlMP: (1x1, Icon $[smallIcons]/resize-wb.png, Action Resize )
*ControlMP: (1x1, Icon $[smallIcons]/move-wb.png, Action Move  )

*ControlMP: (Title Help, Back #028383,  ActionOnPress, \
Action(Mouse 1) Menu MenuStart Rectangle +$left+36 0 12m)

*ControlMP: (Title Revert, Frame 1, Action "Exec exec xfwm4 --replace &" )

Module FvwmButtons ControlMP

## Style Setting

Style ControlMP !Borders, !Title, WindowListSkip, StaysOnTop, Sticky, NeverFocus

